{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The EGO demo gives you access to a non-narrative preview of the game\u2019s first part. you will be able to play around with all of the character\u2019s moveset, 4 enemies types, 4 unique levels and a preview of the first boss.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Plan_de_travail_34@2x.png?t=1747213031\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Gif1_opti.gif?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight robots by smoking in their faces! Inhale your magical substances and exhale smoke to attack, ignite it to deal more damage!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Plan_de_travail_34_copie@2x.png?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Gif2_opti.gif?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EGO has more than a lot of smoke particles, it lets you fight intense 1v100 battles! destroy thousands of robots and beat the best score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Plan_de_travail_34_copie_2@2x.png?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Gif3_opti.gif?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To beat the best score, you\u2019ll also have to master the high speed and versatile movement of the old wizard! Climb and fly by mastering the dash extend mechanic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Plan_de_travail_34_copie_3@2x.png?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Gif4_opti.gif?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As movement and smoke fight mechanics mix, find the most efficient way to the Bus! Speedrun an array of open-ended levels and become the best smoking wizard!</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Plan_de_travail_34_copie_4@2x.png?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/extras/Gif5_opti.gif?t=1747213031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After destroying a whole industry line of robots, EGO lets you destroy unique and gigantic robots!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692700?t=1747213031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692700?t=1747213031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/6e54c32112207854cb626fab48d0da4656f3cd3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747213031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692700/6e54c32112207854cb626fab48d0da4656f3cd3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747213031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The EGO demo gives you acces